{
  "name": "Enrich CRM leads from company websites (AlterLab)",
  "description": "Automatically enrich CRM leads by scraping company websites for contact info, employee count, tech stack, and services. AlterLab extracts structured company data from any website — including JavaScript-rendered pages that block standard HTTP requests.\n\nInput a list of company URLs from your CRM and get back enriched B2B data ready to import back. Works with HubSpot, Salesforce, Airtable, or any spreadsheet.\n\nPowered by AlterLab web scraping API. Get started free at https://app.alterlab.io/signin",
